Local chat helper
- A helper script was added at `scripts/local_chat_helper.py` to snapshot and restore uncommitted changes and to produce a concise context bundle for a local chat agent or human reviewer. Usage examples:
  ```bash
  # snapshot uncommitted work (creates .qmoi_local_chat/ metadata and patch)
  python3 scripts/local_chat_helper.py snapshot

  # produce a JSON context bundle to attach to an LLM prompt or PR description
  python3 scripts/local_chat_helper.py context > reports/local_chat_context.json

  # restore from a patch file saved in .qmoi_local_chat
  python3 scripts/local_chat_helper.py restore --patch=uncommitted_20251122T090000Z.patch

  # pop the most recent local_chat snapshot stash
  python3 scripts/local_chat_helper.py restore --pop
  ```

Local chat agent helper
- Added `scripts/local_chat_helper.py` — a small CLI that snapshots uncommitted work to `wip/snapshot/<name>` branches, creates patches, and restores them. Use tools to safely allow the assistant to operate on a clean tree and re-apply WIP changes.

CI build workflow
- Added `.github/workflows/pwa-build.yml` to build PWA and web artifacts on PRs and pushes. This allows the repository to produce `dist`/`.next` artifacts even when local container cannot install Node.
